				3
			],
			"Message": "build(Project): Coordinate Sky workbench URL paths and Worker target rebuilds\n\nSynchronize three Land submodules with build configuration and target updates:\n\n- **Sky**: Standardize VS Code workbench loading by replacing @codeeditorland/output package specifiers with runtime /vs/ URL paths. Apply is:inline to bypass Vite/Rollup bundling, use variable assignment for truly dynamic imports, add try/catch error handling, and update astro.config.ts external resolver for /vs/ prefix.\n\n- **Worker**: Rebuild all target files (Worker.js, CSS/Load.js, Policy.js, Register.js) following ESBuild configuration changes. No functional changes, target files regenerated with current configuration.\n\n- **Mountain**: Submodule pointer update.\n\nThis resolves Rollup's inability to resolve package specifiers at build time while maintaining dynamic loading at runtime.",
			"SHA": "5b04b8ffe42664ac65bb799574d7ebf13048e997"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-06T10:21:04Z",
			"File": [
				"⣿⠇⠀⠀⠀",
				28,
				8
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Project): Replace hand-written shims with real VS Code types across Land submodules\n\nCoordinate eight Land submodules with refactoring and build improvements:\n\n- **Cocoon**: Replace hand-written VS Code type shims with re-exports from @codeeditorland/output. Centralize Position, Range, Location, Selection, MarkdownString, Hover, CompletionItem, Diagnostic, TextEdit, WorkspaceEdit and 40+ more types in Platform/VSCode/Type barrel. Remove duplicate shims from Handler.ts, TypeConverter.ts, GRPCServerService.ts, ViewColumn.ts, TreeView/Item.ts, APIFactoryService.ts, Window.ts.\n\n- **Wind**: Replace hand-written type definitions with re-exports from @codeeditorland/output. Swap VSCodeWorkbenchOptionsType, VSCodeConfigurationType, VSCodeLoggerType, FileType, URI, IStat to source from canonical VS Code locations. Fix uri.fsPath() bug where it was called as method instead of getter.\n\n- **Output**: Lazy-load RestPlugin only when Compiler=Rest env var is set, avoiding node:fs imports during normal ESBuild builds.\n\n- **Sky**: Convert workbench.js to dynamic import to prevent Rollup hard-failures on unresolved package specifiers.\n\n- **Rest/Echo/Cocoon**: Dependency updates (protobufjs, @cloudflare/workers-types, @tauri-apps/plugin-fs, @types/node) and POSIX shell redirection style fixes.\n\nThis eliminates duplicate shim implementations scattered across the codebase, establishing @codeeditorland/output as the single source of truth for VS Code types.",
			"SHA": "c1ed90a0645accfbcb7284633adc98cec7d9e9ae"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-06T08:08:56Z",
			"File": [
				"⠇⠀⠀⠀⠀",
